       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. UNLDACCT.
      * Test harness: unloads the updated account file to text for comparison.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT ACCT-IN ASSIGN TO ACCTFILE ORGANIZATION INDEXED
                  ACCESS SEQUENTIAL RECORD KEY AC-ID.
           SELECT ACCT-OUT ASSIGN TO ACCTOUT ORGANIZATION LINE SEQUENTIAL.
       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD ACCT-IN.  01 AC-REC. 05 AC-ID PIC X(11). 05 FILLER PIC X(289).
       FD ACCT-OUT. 01 AO-REC PIC X(300).
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 EOF PIC X VALUE 'N'.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           OPEN INPUT ACCT-IN OUTPUT ACCT-OUT
           PERFORM UNTIL EOF = 'Y'
              READ ACCT-IN AT END MOVE 'Y' TO EOF
                NOT AT END WRITE AO-REC FROM AC-REC
              END-READ
           END-PERFORM
           CLOSE ACCT-IN ACCT-OUT
           STOP RUN.
